      "_comment": "The three measured averages placed at their own sub-blocks, with i_cdac_avg split evenly between the two decode banks. They sum to the measured i_vdd_avg exactly (30.7246 + 9.06449 + 0.330955 = 40.12 uA), because an average IS additive across sources -- unlike the peak below."
    },
    "pvt_worst_peak": {
      "source": "sim/adc-rail-current/records/20260923-002945-1cefe83.md -- the worst `i_vdd_peak_ua` point of the 27-point PVT grid",
      "corner": "ff_-40c_3.63v",
      "measured": {
